    "patched_vulnerabilities": [
      "All 162 CVE-2026 identifiers on Apple's iOS 27.2 page are listed here. 15 are in the Kernel component. 23 have a kernel-memory impact (4 write, 12 corruption, 1 copy-on-write, 6 read or disclosure). 6 are credited to Calif.io and none of those has a kernel-memory impact. The page has no kernel or root privilege entry. The press figure of 163 differs from the 162 identifiers in the extracted text (C-046)."
    ],
    "relevant_kernel_changes": "Apple's iOS 27.2 page lists kernel-memory write, corruption, copy-on-write, read and disclosure entries (research/apple-27x-cve-mapping.md). It states no affected version range, so it does not show whether iOS 27.0.1 was affected (C-047). It has no kernel or root privilege entry (C-074).",
    "exploit_compatibility": "No verified public exploit compatibility for 27.2 on iPhone 15 Pro Max. The Calif.io-credited entries in 27.2 have no kernel-memory impact (C-042).",
